  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/F80D">Corollary <span data-tag="F80D">2.4.7.12</span>.</a> Let $f: \calC \rightarrow \calD $ be a functor between $\infty $-categories. The projection </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \Fun (\Delta ^1, \calD ) \times _{\Fun ( \{ 1\} , \calD ) } \calC \rightarrow \Fun (\{ 0\} , \calD ) \]
</div>
  <p> is a Cartesian fibration. </p>
</article>
